OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for
OL,4,A22-year-old soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for a soldier who went
OL,7,Fmissing after spending the night with
OL,8,Ffriends say they have found a body.
OL,10,FLiam Potts, 22, who served with the
OL,11,FColdstream Guards, was last seen
OL,12,Fheading towards Wylam in Northumberland
OL,13,Ffrom Wylam Bridge at about 00:20 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FSpecialist officers from Northumbria
OL,17,FPolice's Marine Unit have now recovered
OL,18,Fa body from the River Tyne close to the
OL,19,Fbridge.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
